<title>MEXICO: Tablex approves capital increase.</title>
<headline>Tablex approves capital increase.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico food company Tablex S.A. de C.V. has approved an increase in its shareholding capital worth 5,435,274 pesos by issuing 213,148 ordinary class two shares, the company said in a press statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>((--Tomas de la Rosa, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7912))</p>
